  "description": "****Luxury apartments Tallaght Cross East****\r\n\r\nEnquiries via daft.ie only. Interested parties need to click on the ad for the relevant property within this development page to be able to send an email query. \r\n \r\nPlease do not contact either the Comer Group Ireland or Comer Group UK head office via phone call or email regarding lettings - all letting enquiries are handled via the lettings department directly. Any queries through the main office will be disregarded. NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE.**\r\n\r\nLocated at the epicentre of a transpiration hub, Tallaght Cross East boasts a whole host of amenities right on your doorstep. With the Red Line Luas at the foot of the development, the M50 being just minutes away, and the N81 running adjacent to the complex, not to mention all major bus routes converging across the road, getting to and from here is hassle free. Communal bin disposal is included in the monthly rent. Within the development itself is ample secure parking (there is an additional monthly charge to avail of a car space), around the clock security and a management team which is on call 24-7, you can rest assured that this modern complex has all bases covered.\r\n  \r\n Tallaght Cross East is substantially well serviced, with all amenities right on you door step, from the Glashaus Hotel and Ostan Bar (on site), Aldi, Tallaght Hospital, Tallaght IT and The Civic Library to name but a few. Refuse included Sky and UPC available to all apartments (not included in rental price). Apartment in pristine condition for letting. Integrated appliances include washer dryer, fridge freezer, dishwasher, microwave, hob and oven.\r\n\r\n***** Viewing by appointment only - Applications via Daft.ie only to make an appointment. No calls please *****.",
